@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts on Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "SFR008: Request AML Compliance Alerts" as SFR008
  usecase "AIFR006: Generate Contextualized News Insights for Users" as AIFR006

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data and insights  
  Client --> CFR002 : Receive alerts on anomalous transactions  
  Client --> FAFR003 : Review predictive analytics provided by the system  
  Client --> SAFR001 : Adjust analysis parameters for better accuracy  

  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR003 : View client-specific predictive insights during consultations  
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR002 : Manage client intervention alerts to proactively assist clients  
  FinancialAdvisor --> AIFR008 : Request recommendations on when to engage with clients based on system analysis  

  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Configure and manage AI parameters for compliance and accuracy  

  System --> CFR001 : Provide financial data in a consolidated view  
  System --> CFR002 : Deliver alerts through appropriate channels  
  System --> FAFR003 : Supply predictive analytics to clients or advisors  
  System --> SAFR001 : Manage AI parameters for the system  
  System --> SFR008 : Detect and report AML-related transactions  
  System --> AIFR006 : Extract relevant news based on user portfolios  

}

@enduml